<section id="abstract">
  <p>
  This is the interoperability report for implementers of the DID URL
  dereferencing algorithm in the
  <a href="https://www.w3.org/TR/did-resolution/">DID Resolution specification</a>.
  Results are self-reported by each implementation, by dereferencing a fixed
  set of DID URLs against a fixed DID resolution result.
  </p>
</section>
